ment.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/setup.go | Computes root module path(s) during setup and stores them on `SetupPhase` for `$root` expansion. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/setup_test.go | Adds coverage for root module path discovery from `go.mod` and package metadata. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/match.go | Expands `$root` to module glob(s) and matches glob rules using the existing glob matcher. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/match_test.go | Updates glob-target tests for new `targetRule` plumbing; adds tests for `$root` expansion and error behavior. |\r\n| tool/internal/rule/target_glob.go | Defines `TargetRoot` (`$root`) and `IsRootTarget` helper in the rule layer. |\r\n| docs/rules.md | Documents `target: $root` semantics and how it is resolved/expanded. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/629#pullrequestreview-4618732924","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/629","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/629#pullrequestreview-4618732924"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/629"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-02T14:57:47Z","